\transclude{dhsorens-004Q} % simulation extractability

\p{
    Sources: [How to Prove False Statements](https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/118) for why the distinctions are not academic; [On Soundness Notions for Interactive Oracle Proofs](https://eprint.iacr.org/2023/1256) for the implications between them; [ArkLib](https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib)'s \code{OracleReduction/Security} for the same map in Lean.
}
